              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha kiro ky aikumi na bitaano eky'okwezi kwa mushanju, ku muriheza kushaaruura emyaka y'omu misiri, muryagira obugyenyi bw'ebiro bikuru ahari MUKAMA okumara ebiro mushanju; haryabaho okuhuumura okurikwera aha izooba ry'okutandikiraho obwo bugyenyi, kandi n'aha izooba ryabwo rya munaana. ",
